{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Plumber's Legacy</strong> is a charming 2D platformer that pays tribute to the golden age of gaming. Jump, run, and stomp your way through a colorful world filled with tricky platforms, hidden secrets, and the occasional enemy trying to ruin your day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission is simple: make it to the end of each handcrafted level and uncover the plumber's forgotten legacy. Whether you're leaping over lava pits, dodging falling blocks, or bopping baddies on the head, every level brings new challenges and nostalgic fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect for fans of retro platformers, <strong>Plumber's Legacy</strong> offers straightforward gameplay, tight controls, and just the right amount of challenge to keep you coming back for one more run.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3741110?t=1749748101","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3741110?t=1749748101","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741110/60a693d00b156fec935661d0ef0991e909070ec0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749748101","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741110/60a693d00b156fec935661d0ef0991e909070ec0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749748101","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Plumber's Legacy</strong> is a charming 2D platformer that pays tribute to the golden age of gaming. Jump, run, and stomp your way through a colorful world filled with tricky platforms, hidden secrets, and the occasional enemy trying 